      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The process was okay, installation was quick easy and straightforward. The prices they charge are ridiculous, and the interest they charge with payment plans is even more ridiculous. After putting down a deposit, I owed 5,400, and then needed to pay that back over a year. 18.52% interest rate with only a year of repayments. Absolutely shocked, but I had no choice as they had already done the install.If I could go back, I would have gone with another installer that gives much better value, and does the same job for a better price, or maybe no so high interest rates.Originally I was quoted 6,200 for a 9.6kw system with them saying confidently they could fit that many panels. After installation, they called saying they could only fit 8.8kw worth of solar panels. The discount for not fitting as many? $175. It cost 6,025 for the 8.8kw panels. However, they charged me $7,000 all up AFTER REBATES GO TO THEM for this 8.8kw system paid over just a year. Speechless.I was going to recommend this company to friends and family, as the installation was smooth actual solar panels and inverter all worked well, however, this pricing and interest rate is a robbery.",
